# Reqnroll's MSBuild generator writes a `.feature.cs` codebehind file
# next to every `.feature` file it processes. We copy the shared
# conformance corpus into Features/ at build time (see csproj
# CopySharedFeatures target); both the .feature copies and the
# generated codebehind are ephemeral build artifacts.
Features/

